INSERT INTO "Module" (id,"bookId",title,"order","pageCount") VALUES ('b2e1b4b5-4424-5fce-92f4-97e13defffbd','a0000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000f3','Блок 21. Present Continuous',21,0);
INSERT INTO "LessonUnit" (id,"moduleId",title,"orderIndex",kind,"passThreshold",intro) VALUES ('67b0db4e-ec8c-502f-907b-8405050d7de4','b2e1b4b5-4424-5fce-92f4-97e13defffbd','Present Continuous',0,'LESSON',70,$j$[{"type": "rule", "text": "We use the Present Continuous for actions happening now. Affirmative: I am reading. He/She/It is playing. We/You/They are eating."}, {"type": "rule", "text": "Negative long form: He is not playing. Negative short form: He isn't playing. Interrogative: Is he playing? Yes, he is. / No, he isn't."}, {"type": "examples", "items": ["He is reading a book.", "She isn't sleeping.", "Are they eating? Yes, they are."]}]$j$::jsonb);
INSERT INTO "LessonExercise" (id,"unitId","orderIndex",type,instruction,content,xp) VALUES ('345af40d-08f0-5095-b611-725ede1faf97','67b0db4e-ec8c-502f-907b-8405050d7de4',0,'FILL_BLANK','Посмотри на картинки и заполни пропуски глаголом в Present Continuous.',$j${"items": [{"before": "Picture 1: He is", "after": "a book."}, {"before": "Picture 2: He is", "after": "in bed."}, {"before": "Picture 3: He is", "after": "his dinner."}]}$j$::jsonb,10);
